{"seq":2,"slug":"chains-and-agents","title":"链与代理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/chains-and-agents","wordCount":1144,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"链与代理模式\">链与代理模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在 LangChain 中，Chain（链）和 Agent（代理）代表了两种截然不同的 LLM 应用构建范式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两种范式的边界\">两种范式的边界</h3><ul>\n<li>Chain 是预定义的执行路径，每个步骤在编码时就已确定</li>\n<li>Agent 则由 LLM 动态决定下一步操作，具备自主推理和工具调用能力</li>\n<li>理解两者的边界和适用场景是构建可靠 AI 应用的关键</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入]--&gt;B[步骤1]&#10;    B--&gt;C[步骤2]&#10;    C--&gt;E[输出]&#10;    F[输入]--&gt;G{LLM 推理}&#10;    G--&gt;|调用工具|H[工具执行]&#10;    H--&gt;G&#10;    G--&gt;|直接回答|I[输出]\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入]--&gt;B[步骤1]\n    B--&gt;C[步骤2]\n    C--&gt;E[输出]\n    F[输入]--&gt;G{LLM 推理}\n    G--&gt;|调用工具|H[工具执行]\n    H--&gt;G\n    G--&gt;|直接回答|I[输出]</pre><h3 id=\"chain-与-agent-对比\">Chain 与 Agent 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Chain</th>\n<th>Agent</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行路径</td>\n<td>编码时确定</td>\n<td>运行时动态决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可预测性</td>\n<td>高，输出确定性强</td>\n<td>低，依赖 LLM 推理质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>固定流程</td>\n<td>可适应不同输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试难度</td>\n<td>简单，步骤可追踪</td>\n<td>复杂，推理链不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能开销</td>\n<td>低，最少 LLM 调用</td>\n<td>高，多轮交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用例</td>\n<td>RAG、摘要、翻译</td>\n<td>研究助手、代码生成、数据分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"链的构建模式\">链的构建模式</h2><p>LangChain 的链从简单的顺序调用发展到支持并行、分支和条件逻辑的复杂工作流，LCEL 提供了声明式的链构建能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种组合模式\">三种组合模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>核心组件</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顺序</td>\n<td><code>pipe()</code> / <code>RunnableSequence</code></td>\n<td>提示 → 模型 → 解析的固定流水线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行</td>\n<td><code>RunnableParallel</code></td>\n<td>同一输入做分析、摘要等多路处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支</td>\n<td><code>RunnableBranch</code> + 分类链</td>\n<td>按类别路由到不同处理链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"并行链示例\">并行链示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const parallelChain = RunnableParallel.from({&#10;  analysis: analyzeChain,&#10;  summary: summarizeChain,&#10;  original: new RunnablePassthrough(),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parallelChain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RunnableParallel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  analysis: analyzeChain,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  summary: summarizeChain,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  original: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RunnablePassthrough</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分支链示例\">分支链示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const branchChain = RunnableSequence.from([&#10;  { text: new RunnablePassthrough(), category: classifyChain },&#10;  new RunnableBranch([(input) =&gt; input.category.includes(&#39;技术&#39;), techChain], bizChain),&#10;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> branchChain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RunnableSequence.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { text: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RunnablePassthrough</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), category: classifyChain },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RunnableBranch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.category.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'技术'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), techChain], bizChain),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"链的设计原则\">链的设计原则</h3><ul>\n<li>链的设计原则是<strong>最小化 LLM 调用次数</strong></li>\n<li>每次调用都有延迟和成本，应尽量在单次 prompt 中完成更多工作</li>\n<li>只在确实需要不同推理逻辑时才拆分为多步</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"react-代理架构\">ReAct 代理架构</h2><p>ReAct（Reasoning + Acting）是 LangChain Agent 的经典实现模式。LLM 交替进行推理（Thought）和行动（Action），通过观察行动结果（Observation）迭代直到得出最终答案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"创建-react-agent\">创建 ReAct Agent</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const agent = createReactAgent({&#10;  llm: new ChatOpenAI({ modelName: &#39;gpt-4-turbo&#39; }),&#10;  tools: [searchTool, calculator, codeAnalyzer],&#10;});&#10;const result = await agent.invoke({&#10;  messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: &#39;搜索 React 19 的新特性并估算迁移工作量&#39; }],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> agent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createReactAgent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  llm: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChatOpenAI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ modelName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-4-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tools: [searchTool, calculator, codeAnalyzer],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  messages: [{ role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, content: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'搜索 React 19 的新特性并估算迁移工作量'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>版本提示</strong>：<code>createReactAgent</code> 来自 <code>@langchain/langgraph/prebuilt</code>。LangChain 1.0 起，官方推荐以统一的 <code>createAgent</code> 入口创建生产级智能体——它同样实现 ReAct 式的推理-行动循环，并在此基础上提供更完整的生产特性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"自定义结构化工具\">自定义结构化工具</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const codeAnalyzer = new DynamicStructuredTool({&#10;  name: &#39;analyze_code&#39;,&#10;  description: &#39;分析代码片段的复杂度和潜在问题&#39;,&#10;  schema: z.object({ code: z.string(), language: z.string() }),&#10;  func: async ({ code, language }) =&gt; `${language} 代码共 ${code.split(&#39;\\n&#39;).length} 行`,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> codeAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DynamicStructuredTool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'analyze_code'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'分析代码片段的复杂度和潜在问题'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), language: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">language</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 代码共 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">code</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 行`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行循环\">执行循环</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Thought 推理]--&gt;B{需要工具?}&#10;    B--&gt;|是|C[Action 调用]&#10;    C--&gt;D[Observation 观察]&#10;    D--&gt;A&#10;    B--&gt;|否|E[最终答案]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Thought 推理]--&gt;B{需要工具?}\n    B--&gt;|是|C[Action 调用]\n    C--&gt;D[Observation 观察]\n    D--&gt;A\n    B--&gt;|否|E[最终答案]</pre><ul>\n<li>执行过程遵循 Thought → Action → Observation 循环</li>\n<li>LLM 在每一轮根据历史上下文决定是继续调用工具还是直接给出答案</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"优势与局限\">优势与局限</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优势</td>\n<td>通用性强，适配各类任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局限</td>\n<td>推理步骤不可控，可能无限循环或偏离主题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"记忆系统设计\">记忆系统设计</h2><p>Agent 和 Chain 都需要记忆系统来维持上下文连续性。LangChain 提供了多种记忆策略，从简单的对话缓冲到复杂的摘要记忆。</p>\n<h3 id=\"记忆策略对比\">记忆策略对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记忆类型</th>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>Token 消耗</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BufferMemory</td>\n<td>完整对话历史</td>\n<td>线性增长</td>\n<td>短对话（&lt;10轮）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WindowMemory</td>\n<td>最近 K 轮</td>\n<td>固定上限</td>\n<td>中等长度对话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SummaryMemory</td>\n<td>LLM 生成摘要</td>\n<td>压缩后固定</td>\n<td>长对话、多主题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EntityMemory</td>\n<td>实体-关系图</td>\n<td>按实体数量</td>\n<td>需要记住具体信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VectorStoreMemory</td>\n<td>向量检索</td>\n<td>按检索数量</td>\n<td>大规模知识对话</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"配置示例\">配置示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const bufferMemory = new BufferMemory({ memoryKey: &#39;chat_history&#39;, returnMessages: true });&#10;const summaryMemory = new ConversationSummaryMemory({&#10;  llm: new ChatOpenAI({ modelName: &#39;gpt-3.5-turbo&#39; }),&#10;  memoryKey: &#39;chat_history&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bufferMemory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BufferMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ memoryKey: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chat_history'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, returnMessages: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> summaryMemory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConversationSummaryMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  llm: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChatOpenAI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ modelName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-3.5-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  memoryKey: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chat_history'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"生产环境的持久化\">生产环境的持久化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>外部存储</td>\n<td>生产环境记忆通常持久化到 Redis、PostgreSQL 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架支持</td>\n<td><code>ChatMessageHistory</code> 提供多种后端实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理与可靠性\">错误处理与可靠性</h2><p>生产级 Agent 必须具备完善的错误处理机制。LLM 输出的不确定性、工具调用的失败、上下文窗口溢出等问题都需要在框架层面系统性地解决。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重试与降级配置\">重试与降级配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const reliableModel = new ChatOpenAI({ modelName: &#39;gpt-4-turbo&#39;, maxRetries: 3, timeout: 30000 }).withFallbacks({&#10;  fallbacks: [new ChatOpenAI({ modelName: &#39;gpt-3.5-turbo&#39; })],&#10;});&#10;const chainWithRetry = RunnableSequence.from([prompt, reliableModel, outputParser]).withRetry({ stopAfterAttempt: 3 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reliableModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChatOpenAI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ modelName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-4-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxRetries: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withFallbacks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fallbacks: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChatOpenAI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ modelName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-3.5-turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chainWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RunnableSequence.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([prompt, reliableModel, outputParser]).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ stopAfterAttempt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键可靠性策略\">关键可靠性策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>防范的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超时控制</td>\n<td>为每个链设置 <code>timeout</code></td>\n<td>无限等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型降级</td>\n<td><code>withFallbacks</code> 配置备选</td>\n<td>单一模型不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代上限</td>\n<td>Agent 循环设最大迭代次数</td>\n<td>无限循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用追踪</td>\n<td>LangSmith 记录输入输出</td>\n<td>事后分析无依据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Chain 适合确定性流程，Agent 适合需要动态推理的场景，选择取决于任务的结构化程度</li>\n<li>LCEL 支持顺序、并行、分支三种链组合模式，应最小化 LLM 调用次数以控制延迟和成本</li>\n<li>ReAct 是最通用的 Agent 架构，通过 Thought-Action-Observation 循环实现自主推理；LangChain 1.0 的 <code>createAgent</code> 是该循环在当前版本的标准载体</li>\n<li>记忆系统的选择需要在 Token 消耗和信息完整性之间权衡，生产环境需持久化</li>\n<li>错误处理是生产级应用的必要环节，需要在模型层和链层都配置重试与降级策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"链与代理模式","id":"链与代理模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"两种范式的边界","id":"两种范式的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"Chain 与 Agent 对比","id":"chain-与-agent-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"链的构建模式","id":"链的构建模式"},{"level":3,"text":"三种组合模式","id":"三种组合模式"},{"level":3,"text":"并行链示例","id":"并行链示例"},{"level":3,"text":"分支链示例","id":"分支链示例"},{"level":3,"text":"链的设计原则","id":"链的设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"ReAct 代理架构","id":"react-代理架构"},{"level":3,"text":"创建 ReAct Agent","id":"创建-react-agent"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义结构化工具","id":"自定义结构化工具"},{"level":3,"text":"执行循环","id":"执行循环"},{"level":3,"text":"优势与局限","id":"优势与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"记忆系统设计","id":"记忆系统设计"},{"level":3,"text":"记忆策略对比","id":"记忆策略对比"},{"level":3,"text":"配置示例","id":"配置示例"},{"level":3,"text":"生产环境的持久化","id":"生产环境的持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理与可靠性","id":"错误处理与可靠性"},{"level":3,"text":"重试与降级配置","id":"重试与降级配置"},{"level":3,"text":"关键可靠性策略","id":"关键可靠性策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LangChain 框架全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langchain-overview"},"next":{"title":"LangChain 工具系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langchain-tools"}}